/member/2826-mikerand","name":"mikerand","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2826_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"161"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-26T17:03:37-07:00","id":120037,"title":"","content":"I was more thinking of things like action, adventure, intrigue and so on. Also your feelings on character death, house-rules, pvp behavior etc. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1734-asaram","name":"Asaram","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1734_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"331"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-26T17:58:43-07:00","id":120067,"title":"","content":"Sure, sounds good to me","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2155-manorcaveman","name":"ManOrCaveman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2155_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-26T20:02:09-07:00","id":120104,"title":"","content":"All of those are important to storytelling. And that's the best part about WoD. Character death sometimes happens but to kill off a character just for the sake of killing is a waste and bound to leave some harsh feelings at the table. As far as house rules I'll follow anything set but I am not a rules lawyer. If a rule in game doesn't work and the ST doesn't want to use it I don't mind if he throws it out the window. PVP really shouldn't happen too often in WoD. Sure sometimes characters disagree, even to the point of one killing the other but all of them should work together for the common goal. PVP should only be in video games. My goal at any gaming session is to play my character. Enjoy doing so and hopefully have the other players have a good as time as I am doing so.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2819-thingjob","name":"thingjob","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-27T18:13:36-07:00","id":120644,"title":"","content":"I'm artisticsoul347 on Skype. I'm not currently running a game right now, but I always enjoy having more people to play with or just to talk about gaming-related topics with.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2712,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2712-zephlin","user":"Zephlin","date":". 04-27-2014, 09:22 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2712-zephlin","name":"Zephlin","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2712_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"17"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-04-28T16:14:11-07:00","id":121281,"title":"","content":"I'm manorcaveman on Skype","signature":"","edited":{"userid":2155,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2155-manorcaveman","user":"ManOrCaveman","date":". 04-28-2014, 07:19 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2155-manorcaveman","name":"ManOrCaveman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2155_2.jpeg","title":"Member",